  unitName: Roaring Thunder Viktor
  unitId: 40827
  unitNumber: 1451
  description: Viktor's love for his clan was such that he gave everything he had
    to avenge its destruction, including his life. Some say that the leader of the
    dragon demons claimed that this very emotional side of Viktor's was what ultimately
    lead to his demise. Had he been able to approach the situation in a more logical
    and tactical manner, he might have been able to eventually repel and even corner
    the dragon demons. But even that would have perhaps been driven by his animosity
    against their leader and their race.
  summonDesc: Destruction! Victory! Slaughter!<br>This feels good!<br>I feel like
    a true demon!
  fusionDesc: I'll pay you back for this<br>by showing you...<br>Showing you the
    agonizing cries of the depths of hell!
  evoDesc: Now I understand...<br>If I had let myself tap into this power, I would've
    been invincible!
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
